    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the alcoholic beverage control law, in relation to permitting the holder of a wholesaler's license to sell certain food and seasonal specialty items and to install and operate automated teller machines",
    "basePrintNo": "S2133",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2133-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
